id: pm-nrkjik
title: "GH-1233: Make strict ownership recovery executable for annotation writes"
description: Keep ownership semantics explicit across append notes comments and learnings; remove unavailable package suggestions and prove the supported claim then append recovery preserves evidence. Document merge safety separately from ownership authorization.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-11T06:19:11.614Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-11T06:59:01.210Z"
