completed_at: "2026-09-11T06:59:00.510Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "All annotation refusal hints name executable recovery; real strict-ownership SDK CLI and MCP scenarios preserve owner data and history, and reject unapproved overrides."
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make governance contracts independently understandable and executable across all transports
value: Reduce agent retry cost while preserving declared workspace guarantees
parent: pm-f05lsg
repro_steps: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1233"
resolution: Provide installable package discovery and truthful owner-release/claim guidance for strict annotation refusal.
expected_result: Approved package appends preserve ownership; edits and deletes refuse; ordinary handoff requires current owner release before claim.
actual_result: Installed-package acceptance passed all three annotation collections and six edit/delete refusals; real manual handoff and verified history succeeded.
